      <description><![CDATA[
            <div class="content-box" id="content">
                <style>     div[type]{-webkit-border-radius: 4pt; border-radius: 4pt;overflow:hidden;}     div[type] img{ -webkit-border-radius: 4pt;border-radius: 4pt;}     p{font-family:'苹方','PingFang','\82f95b9','微软雅黑','Microsoft YaHei','XinGothic-SinaWeibo', helvetica, arial, sans-serif;} 	.initFade{ 	    -webkit-transition:opacity 1s; 	    -o-transition:opacity 1s; 	    transition:opacity 1s; 		opacity:0; 	}     .jijin{margin-top: 1.222em !important;padding-bottom: 0.333em;}.jijin_img{display: block;}h3+p{line-height: 12px !important;padding: 4px !important;margin: 0 !important;overflow: visible;}h3+p span{height: 1.72em;line-height: 1.72em;top: 0;}style+p{margin-top: 1.139em;}style+div[type*='GIF'],style+div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.222em !important;}div + div[type*='GIF'], div + div[type*='IMG']{margin-top: 1.778em !important;}div[type*='GIF']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} div[type*='IMG']{margin: -0.111em auto 0 !important;} body,p{text-align: justify;line-height: 1.72em !important;} p{word-wrap: break-word;overflow:hidden;max-width:100%;word-break: normal !important;margin: 1.44em 0;}.img-info{font-size:0.8333em;line-height:1.53333em!important;text-align:left;color:#999;margin:1.0666em 0 -0.29833em;}   .sub-tlt{position:relative;font-weight: bold;text-indent:0.7777em;}   .sub-tlt:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0.86em;width:0.333em;height:0.333em;background:#333;-webkit-transform:translateY(-50%);transform:translateY(-50%)}.img-info + div[type*='GIF'],.img-info + div[type*='IMG']{margin: 1.777em auto 0 !important;}</style><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.8" data="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260821/202608210539274279.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260821/202608210539274279_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260821/202608210539274279_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【热点新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-20/6a871e85eef32native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：U17女足vs阿森纳U17不再进行补赛，阿森纳抽签胜出晋级决赛</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.81" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260820/202608202221009928.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.81" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.81" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260820/202608202221009928.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260820/202608202221009928.jpg"> </div><p>中国女足U17vs阿森纳女足U17的比赛受雷电天气影响中途中断。经官方消息确认，本场赛事不再进行补赛，阿森纳女足U17抽签取胜，晋级决赛。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-21/6a872cd78be3anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">英媒：热刺提交贷款备案文件，提前拿到约9000万英超相关奖金</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_191117/5dd09714ccc0d.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_191117/5dd09714ccc0d.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_191117/5dd09714ccc0d.jpg"> </div><p>伦敦足球网报道，热刺再次签署了一笔通过麦格理银行获取的现金贷款操作，从而提前拿到了未来应得的英超联赛相关奖金。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-21/6a87349ce6625native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">卡里克：拉什福德完全能胜任中锋 绝不会说曼联无法夺英超冠军</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_190110/5c36a2acdb79f.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_190110/5c36a2acdb79f.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_190110/5c36a2acdb79f.jpg"> </div><p>新赛季英超首轮比赛，曼联将前往客场挑战升班马赫尔城，卡里克出席赛前发布会。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-21/6a87304407471native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">卡里克：德里赫特、舍什科已恢复训练 芒特周末能否出战仍未可知</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-21/6a8738583c89fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：德科和弗里克决定暂时剥夺德容队长袖标，9月2日后进行票选</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250425/680af9a1585c0.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250425/680af9a1585c0.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250425/680af9a1585c0.jpg"> </div><p>记者Javi Miguel报道，弗里克和德科决定暂时剥夺弗兰基·德容的队长袖标，因为他们认为公众对其演讲的反应可能会给甘伯杯蒙上阴影。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-21/6a873adfd6d09native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">连续征战意甲年数：国米97年遥遥领先，罗马74年位居次席</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260821/202608210135447730.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260821/202608210135447730.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260821/202608210135447730.jpg"> </div><p>德国转会市场盘点了各队连续征战意大利顶级联赛的年数（含2026-27赛季），国米以97年居首，罗马74年位居次席。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-21/6a873fae8608bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">进球网预测新赛季英超：卡里克圣诞节前下课 阿韦洛亚第1个被解雇</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260821/202608210158097229.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260821/202608210158097229.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260821/202608210158097229.jpg"> </div><p>《进球网》对新赛季英超做出了5个大胆预测，比如卡里克可能在圣诞节前被解雇，纽卡陷入降级危机等。</p><p><strong>【转会新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-21/6a87851e39cd0native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">Here We Go！罗马诺：热刺签曼城边锋萨维尼奥，转会费超7500万镑</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260821/202608210653298955_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260821/202608210653298955_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260821/202608210653298955_720.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺以标志性的“Here We Go”确认，热刺将签下22岁曼城边锋萨维尼奥，转会费超7500万镑。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-20/6a871f516054anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">DO：利物浦5000万镑报价明特被布莱顿拒绝 球员预计伤缺8周</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.33" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250920/68cec9c0ddaa0.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.33" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.33" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250920/68cec9c0ddaa0.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250920/68cec9c0ddaa0.jpg"> </div><p>奥恩斯坦消息，利物浦5000万镑报价明特被布莱顿拒绝。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-21/6a87645db75bdnative.htm#pl_box" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">世体：马竞改变立场愿卖小蜘蛛去阿森纳，球员拒绝、仍想去巴萨</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260821/202608210433403300.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260821/202608210433403300_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260821/202608210433403300_720.jpg"> </div><p>《世界体育报》报道，马竞改变立场愿将阿尔瓦雷斯卖给阿森纳，但球员拒绝，他仍想去巴萨。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-21/6a877cb2b33f8native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">英媒：热刺接近8500万镑签萨维尼奥，还想要马尔穆什和加克波</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250105/6779d4e073cee.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250105/6779d4e073cee.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250105/6779d4e073cee.jpg"> </div><p>talkSPORT报道，热刺和曼城即将就萨维尼奥的转会达成协议。一份价值8500万英镑的报价预计将被接受，这将创下曼城队史的出售纪录。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-20/6a87142e3b41fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺：曼联有信心签下巴莱巴，同时询问巴尔德转会可能性</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251130/692b43bc53c37.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251130/692b43bc53c37.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251130/692b43bc53c37.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺消息，曼联有信心签下巴莱巴，并询问巴尔德离队可能性，但球员原则上不想离队。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-21/6a87295f2693bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">亿级交易！记者：热刺接近1亿欧签下曼城前锋萨维尼奥 将签约五年</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.56" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250105/6779d4e073cee.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.56" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.56" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250105/6779d4e073cee.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250105/6779d4e073cee.jpg"> </div><p>记者埃杜阿尔多·布尔戈斯报道，效力于曼城的巴西球员萨维尼奥接近加盟热刺，转会费约1亿欧。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-21/6a872ecfbdd0anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">每体：曼联有意巴尔德，巴萨考虑过出售 球员本人则希望留队</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251130/692b43bc53c37.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251130/692b43bc53c37.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251130/692b43bc53c37.jpg"> </div><p>《每日体育报》消息，曼联希望在夏窗末期引进一名左后卫，他们在关注巴萨球员巴尔德。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-21/6a874531124e4native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">跟队：明特加盟利物浦、巴莱巴加盟曼联两笔转会最终可能都会成行</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.51" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250814/689d9807c86a3.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.51" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.51" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250814/689d9807c86a3.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_250814/689d9807c86a3.jpg"> </div><p>布莱顿跟队记者Andy Naylor报道，明特加盟利物浦、巴莱巴加盟曼联这两笔转会最终可能都会成行。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-21/6a874e4c5e9a6native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺：尤文即将和阿图尔协商解约，球员希望自由身离队</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_210213/6027ed3baaacf.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_210213/6027ed3baaacf.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_210213/6027ed3baaacf.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺报道，尤文图斯与巴西中场阿图尔即将协商解约，双方已就提前终止合同达成原则性一致。</p><script> 	$(function(){ 	    $(".video-bg").find('span').click(function(){/*视频播放*/             var _this = this;             var index = $(".video-bg span").index(this);             var MediaArr = document.getElementsByTagName("video");             $(this).parent().hide();             MediaArr[index].play();             MediaArr[index].controls = true;             $(".video-box").each(function(i, item) {                 if ($(this).find('span').get(0) !== _this) {                     $(this).find('.video-bg').show();                     MediaArr[i].pause();                     MediaArr[i].controls = false;                 }             })         });  	if(typeof(canLoadImage)=='function'){/*新版图片打开方式定义*/ 		if(!((typeof(getNetType)==='function' && getNetType()) || canLoadImage())){             $(".img_wrap").css('background-color', '#D9D9DA').find('.play_btn').css('text-indent','0');         } 		var platform = $('input[name="platform"]').val(); 		platform = platform=='ios'?'ios':'android'; 		var img_op = img_op_value = ''; 		function show_small_gif1(){ 			$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 				img_op = get_img_op_attr($(this),platform); 				img_op_value = get_op(img_op,platform); 				var lineHeight = $(this).find('.play_btn').height();  				if((img_op_value==1||img_op_value==2||img_op_value==3||img_op_value==4||img_op_value==7)&&$(this).attr("data-thumb")!=''){ 				    $(this).css('background-image',"url('"+$(this).attr("data-thumb")+"')"); 				    $(this).find('.play_btn').html('').css('font-size','3em').css('color','white').css('line-height', lineHeight + 'px').css('background', 'url(https://static4style.duoduocdn.com/common/img/ic_gif_big@3x.png) no-repeat center center').css('background-size','104px'); 				} 			}); 		}  		setTimeout(show_small_gif1(),100); 		/*load_type 1=wifi,2=4G&&loadimg,3=4G&&noloadimg*/ 		function load_img(this_obj,load_type,status) { 			img_op = get_img_op_attr(this_obj,platform); 			img_op_value = get_op(img_op,platform); 			/*var img = this_obj.children('img:first');*/ 			var img = this_obj.find('img:eq(0)'); 			if(load_type==1){ 				if(img_op_value==1 || img_op_value==7){ 					if(img.attr('t-rc')==img.attr('src')){ 						open_img(img_op_value,platform,img.attr('t-rc')); 					}else{ 						this_obj.find('.play_btn').hide(); 						img.attr('src', img.attr('t-rc')); 					} 				}else if(status==1){ 					open_img(img_op_value,platform,img.attr('t-rc')); 				} 			}else if(load_type==2&&this_obj.attr('type')=='IMG'){ 				this_obj.find('.play_btn').hide(); 				img.attr('src', img.attr('t-rc')); 			} 			if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){                 img.load(function(){                     window.webkit.messageHandlers.imageLoaded.postMessage('test');                 }); 			}else if(platform=='ios'&&typeof(imageLoaded)=='function'){ 				img.load(function(){ 				    /*加载完成*/                     imageLoaded(); 				}); 			} 		}; 		 		var ms = 1000; 		if(platform === 'android'){ 		    ms = 10; 		} 		setTimeout(function(){ 			if(typeof(getNetType)=='function' && getNetType()){/*wifi*/ 			$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 				load_img($(this),1,0) 				}); 			}else{ 				if(canLoadImage()){/*载入图片*/ 					$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 						load_img($(this),2,0) 					}); 			}else{ 				$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 					load_img($(this),3,0); 				}); 			} 			} 		}, ms);  		$(".img_wrap").click( 				function(){ 				    var jumpUrl = $(this).attr('jump-url');                     if(jumpUrl){                         return openLink(jumpUrl);                     } 					load_img($(this),1,1); 					event.stopPropagation(); 				} 			); 		$('a').click(function(e){ 			img_op = get_img_op_attr($(this),platform); 			img_op_value = parseInt(get_op(img_op,platform)); 			if(img_op_value>=0&&img_op_value<=7){ 				open_img(img_op_value,platform,$(this).attr('href')); 				if ( e && e.preventDefault ) 					e.preventDefault(); 				else 					window.event.returnValue = false;  				return false; 			}     	}); 	}else{/*旧版本*/ 		function show_small_gif(){ 			$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 				/*console.log($(this).css('background-image'));*/ 				$(this).find('.play_btn').css("text-indent","0"); 				if($(this).attr("data-ratio") && /gif/i.test($(this).attr("type")) ){                     var ratio = $(this).attr("data-ratio");                     $(this).css({width:"100%",height:0,"padding-top":100/ratio+"%"}).find(".play_btn").css({top:0,height:'100%'});                 } 				if($(this).attr("data-thumb")!=''){                     $(this).append('<img class="img-thumb" style="position: absolute;top: 0;left: 0;width: 100%;height: 100%;object-fit: cover;" src="'+ $(this).attr("data-thumb") +'" />'); 					$(this).find('.play_btn').html('').css('font-size','3em').css('color','white').css('background', 'url(https://static4style.duoduocdn.com/common/img/ic_gif_big@3x.png) no-repeat center center').css('background-size','104px'); 				} 			}); 		}; 		show_small_gif(); 		$(".img_wrap").click(function (event) { 		    var jumpUrl = $(this).attr('jump-url'); 			if(jumpUrl){ 				return openLink(jumpUrl); 			} 			if ($(this).attr('type') == 'IMG') {                 $(this).css("width", 'auto');                 $(this).css("height", 'auto');                 $(this).css("background", 'none');                 $(this).removeClass("img_wrap");                 $(this).find('.play_btn').hide();                 var img = $(this).find('img:eq(0)');                 img.attr('src', img.attr('t-rc'));                 img.attr('data-src', img.attr('t-rc'));                 event.stopPropagation();             }else{                 $(this).find('.play_btn').hide();                 var img = $(this).find('img:eq(0)');                 img.attr('src', img.attr('t-rc')).on("load",function(){                     $(this).css({width:"auto",height:"auto","padding-top":0,background:"none"});                     $(this).find('.img-thumb').remove();                 }.bind(this));                 img.attr('data-src', img.attr('t-rc'));             } 		});  	    if(typeof(getNetType)=='function' && getNetType()){             /*$(".img_wrap").click();*/             setTimeout('$(".img_wrap").click()',200); 		}else{/*旧版非gif图片3G直接载入图片*/             $(".img_wrap").each(function(i){                 if($(this).attr('type')=='IMG'){                     var img = $(this).find('img:eq(0)');                     var ratio = $(this).attr("data-ratio");                     if(ratio){                         $(this).css({                             width:'100%',                             height:0,                            'padding-top':100/ratio+'%'                         }).find(".play_btn").css({                             top:0,                             height:'100%'                         });                         img.attr('src', img.attr('t-rc')).on("load",function(){                           $(this).css({'padding-top':'0'}).find(".play_btn").hide();                         }.bind(this));                     }else{                       $(this).css("width", 'auto');                       $(this).css("height", 'auto');                       $(this).css("background", 'none');                       $(this).removeClass("img_wrap");                       $(this).find('.play_btn').hide();                       img.attr('src', img.attr('t-rc'));                    }                 }             }); 		} 	}  	function get_op(img_op,platform){ 		img_op_arr = img_op.split('|'); 		if(img_op_arr.length!=4)return 5; 		switch (platform){             case 'android' :                 value = img_op_arr[0].split('_');                 break;             case 'ios' :                 value = img_op_arr[1].split('_');                 break;             case 'wap' :                 value = img_op_arr[2].split('_');                 break;             case 'pc' :                 value = img_op_arr[3].split('_');                 break;             default :                 value = [5,''];         }         return value[0]; 	}  	function get_img_op_attr(img_ele,platform){ 		if(platform=='android'){ 			if(window.zhibo8OpenImage && window.zhibo8OpenImage.openInnerExplorerBrowser){ 				op_value = img_ele.attr('img_op_new'); 			}else{ 				op_value = img_ele.attr('img_op'); 			} 		}else if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){ 			if(window.webkit && window.webkit.messageHandlers && window.webkit.messageHandlers.openInnerExplorerBrowser){ 				op_value = img_ele.attr('img_op_new'); 			}else{ 				op_value = img_ele.attr('img_op'); 			} 		}else{ 			op_value = img_ele.attr('img_op'); 		} 		return op_value; 	} 	 	function openLink(aHref) {         if(!aHref) return;         var aNode = document.createElement('a');         aNode.href = aHref;         aNode.click();     }  	function open_img(img_op_value,platform,src){ /*		if(!(img_op_value==1||img_op_value==2||img_op_value==3||img_op_value==4)){ 			return false; 		}*/ 		/*if(src=''||src==undefine)return;*/ 		if(img_op_value==1){ 			if(platform=='android'){ 				window.zhibo8OpenImage.openNativeImageBrowser(src); 			}else if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){ 				window.webkit.messageHandlers.openNativeImageBrowser.postMessage(src); 			}else{ 				openNativeImageBrowser(src); 			} 		}else if(img_op_value==2){ 			if(platform=='android'){ 				window.zhibo8OpenImage.openImageLinkWebBrowser(src); 			}else if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){ 				window.webkit.messageHandlers.openImageLinkWebBrowser.postMessage(src); 			}else{ 				openImageLinkWebBrowser(src); 			} 		}else if(img_op_value==3){ 			if(platform=='android'){ 				window.zhibo8OpenImage.openWebViewImageBrowser(src); 			}else if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){ 				window.webkit.messageHandlers.openWebViewImageBrowser.postMessage(src); 			}else{ 				openWebViewImageBrowser(src); 			} 		}else if(img_op_value==4){ 			if(platform=='android'){ 				window.zhibo8OpenImage.openSystemWebViewBrowser(src); 			}else if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){ 				window.webkit.messageHandlers.openSystemWebViewBrowser.postMessage(src); 			}else{ 				openSystemWebViewBrowser(src); 			} 		}else if(img_op_value==7){ 			if(platform=='android'){ 				window.zhibo8OpenImage.openInnerExplorerBrowser(src); 			}else if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){ 				window.webkit.messageHandlers.openInnerExplorerBrowser.postMessage(src); 			}else{ 				openSystemWebViewBrowser(src); 			} 		} 	} 	}) </script><style>.video-box{position:relative;}.video-bg{position: absolute;z-index: 8 !important;width: 100%;height: 100%;background-color: transparent;}.video-bg span{position: absolute;left: 50%;top:50%;margin-left: -2.94em;margin-top:  -2.94em;width: 5.88em;height: 5.88em;background: url(https://static4style.duoduocdn.com/m_images/inside/outs/ic_play@2x.png) center/46px no-repeat;}.video-bg span{position: absolute;width: 100px;height: 100px;left: 50%;top:50%;margin-left: -50px;margin-top:  -50px;}</style>
